          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "结论提到需要整合跨尺度机制探索和标准化临床转化路径。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba6faeb60e6135f42c59cc7b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0001"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9999f33c5d2cb360fe617601",
          "source_handle": "P0001",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该论文为文献计量学综述，其“发现”是基于文献计数的统计结果（如关键词频率、引用中心性），而非生物学实验的直接观察。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba6faeb60e6135f42c59cc7b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0001"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::4e780b89aa8335294feadf2e",
          "source_handle": "P0001",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "摘要中提到的“Ruminococcus”, “Bifidobacterium”, “L-selenomethionine”仅为背景介绍中已确认的作用，非本论文的新发现，引用时需区分这是领域共识还是本文贡献。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::ba6faeb60e6135f42c59cc7b"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0001"
        },
        {
