          "source_handle": "P0001",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "关键词“colorectal cancer”的高频出现提示该癌种研究较多，但不能推断所有实体瘤的微生物机制相同，需注意不同癌种的异质性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
