          "value": "methods",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a54c4177705f169c0abc452e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0030"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6ac9ad2bebc7059ddafc25a8",
          "source_handle": "P0030",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "针对早期至中期HCC患者在接受TACE联合MWA等根治性局部治疗后面临高复发率（5年内高达70%）且缺乏标准化辅助治疗的问题，探究短程辅助PD-1抑制剂（特瑞普利单抗）是否能有效降低复发风险并改善预后，同时评估其安全性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a54c4177705f169c0abc452e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0030"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2c32d64fd11413e8e7d895d8",
          "source_handle": "P0030",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象为巴塞罗那肝癌临床分期（BCLC）A–B期肝细胞癌（HCC）患者；情境为经动脉化疗栓塞（TACE）联合微波消融（MWA）局部治疗后达到完全缓解（CR）的高复发风险人群；范围聚焦于评估短期辅助免疫检查点抑制剂（特瑞普利单抗/Tislelizumab）的疗效与安全性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a54c4177705f169c0abc452e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0030"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::8830c3ef754ce06dd585ec36",
          "source_handle": "P0030",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇单臂、前瞻性、II期临床试验方案，旨在评估在TACE联合MWA治疗BCLC A–B期HCC并确认完全缓解后，使用6个月短程辅助特瑞普利单抗（200 mg，每3周一次）的疗效和安全性。研究主要终点为无复发生存期（RFS），次要终点包括局部肿瘤进展、肝内远处复发、肝外疾病时间、总生存期及不良事件。该研究基于TACE诱导免疫原性细胞死亡与MWA协同作用产生有利免疫微环境的理论假设，试图验证短程辅助免疫治疗的可行性。由于这是一份试验方案（Protocol），目前尚未报告实际的患者入组数据或最终结果。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a54c4177705f169c0abc452e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0030"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7b77312891d3e4cc2ea696c0",
          "source_handle": "P0030",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅提供方案设定，不提供疗效对比数据；不能证明该方案优于其他方案或观察性研究中的效果。",
            "contribution": "明确了TACE联合MWA后辅助使用PD-1抑制剂的具体给药方案（特瑞普利单抗 200mg q3w x 6个月）及适用人群（BCLC A-B, CR状态）。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a54c4177705f169c0abc452e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0030"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0a3f8d22a54c5b8ceceaa816",
          "source_handle": "P0030",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这是基于文献引用的理论机制阐述，而非本研究实测的机制数据；不同介入方式（如RFA vs MWA）的效果可能存在差异，需注意外推限制。",
            "contribution": "阐述了TACE和MWA通过诱导缺血、化疗毒性及热损伤导致免疫原性细胞死亡，释放肿瘤新抗原，从而重塑肿瘤免疫微环境并增强T细胞反应的机制假设。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a54c4177705f169c0abc452e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0030"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0c606f0b8f28a6531283f01e",
          "source_handle": "P0030",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "文中指出目前尚无标准化的辅助治疗方案，IMbrave050等III期研究结果存在长期获益不维持的情况，且多数研究聚焦于手术切除而非消融/介入治疗后的辅助治疗。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a54c4177705f169c0abc452e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
