          "value": {
            "material": "文中提到近期研究表明6个月的维持免疫治疗可提供与连续治疗相当的疗效，同时具有良好的安全性和依从性。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a54c4177705f169c0abc452e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0030"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::dc42c1b1a9a199905719b905",
          "source_handle": "P0030",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究为单臂试验方案，无对照组，因此任何关于疗效的声称均为预期值或基于历史数据的推测，不能作为确证性证据。",
