        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bb9cf892c940f97762694aaf",
          "source_handle": "P0031",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管微生物组在精准医学中展现出巨大潜力，但当前面临的主要障碍是什么？如何将微生物组数据有效整合到临床决策中以实现真正的个性化预防、诊断和治疗？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0031"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d06066d95fe2d4cf0ab6fadd",
          "source_handle": "P0031",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "人类微生物组（Human Microbiome）在精准医学（Precision Medicine）中的应用前景，涵盖疾病风险分层、治疗应用及肿瘤学领域。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0031"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c5b931bcf0e389024f9c17af",
          "source_handle": "P0031",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇编辑引言/观点文章，旨在探讨人类微生物组如何作为精准医学的新前沿重塑疾病病理学理解及个性化医疗策略。文章指出微生物组不仅是健康的被动反映者，更是代谢、免疫和药物反应等关键功能的动态参与者。作者综述了微生物组在早期诊断生物标志物开发、药代动力学影响（Pharmacomicrobiomics）、以及通过粪菌移植（FMT）或定制益生菌进行干预方面的潜力，同时分析了将其整合到临床实践中面临的标准化、因果推断、数据隐私及监管挑战，并展望了多组学联合与人工智能驱动的未来方向。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0031"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::5b59140d7e2229eee427ca6e",
          "source_handle": "P0031",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅陈述关联性，未提供具体菌株或代谢物如何调节T细胞功能或肿瘤微环境的具体机制细节；未限定于特定类型的固体瘤，需结合其他实证研究细化。",
            "contribution": "确认了肠道微生物组组成与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效及毒性的关联，指出微生物特征可用于预测预后和指导治疗策略。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0031"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d000b902024313e63163e159",
          "source_handle": "P0031",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "本文本身未阐明具体机制路径，仅作为问题提出的来源；其提到的机制多为一般性描述，缺乏针对固体瘤微环境的特异性解释。",
            "contribution": "提出了微生物组通过代谢产物（促进或抑制肿瘤生长）和影响免疫反应来参与疾病进程的假设性机制框架；指出了因果推断困难是当前知识瓶颈。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
