        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d85047c537211385cef39384",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "采用叙述性综述方法。通过梳理文献，从基础生物学背景（肠道菌群功能、癌症微环境）出发，过渡到临床观察（益生菌对胃肠道毒性的缓解作用），再深入到分子机制层面（特定菌株对免疫检查点抑制剂的调节）。文章综合了体外实验、动物模型（FMT移植）和人体临床试验的结果，并对特定菌株LGG进行了专题深入分析。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::edb4f97c95ad6d197c44f501",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "系统综述了肠道微生物群调节免疫检查点抑制剂疗效的最新证据，并提供了益生菌缓解抗癌治疗胃肠道毒性的临床数据汇总。",
            "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究；对于益生菌增强免疫治疗疗效的机制多为相关性描述或动物模型推断，缺乏大规模前瞻性人体干预试验的直接因果证据；未提供具体的荟萃分析统计结果。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::bba8ee6803b73e5fdd19167b",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "黑色素瘤患者接受抗PD-1/PD-L1免疫治疗",
            "finding": "作者转述了Routy等人和Gopalakrishnan等人的研究，发现响应者肠道中富集Akkermansia、Alistipes、Clostridiales等菌属；粪菌移植（FMT）至无菌小鼠可改善PD-1阻断疗效，表明特定肠道菌群能增强免疫检查点抑制剂的抗肿瘤效果。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d35f3c7fa718acde685707ba",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "接受化疗或放疗的结直肠癌及其他实体瘤患者",
            "finding": "多项随机对照试验显示，口服益生菌（如L. johnsonii, L. acidophilus, B. longum, S. boulardii）能显著减少治疗相关的腹泻、黏膜炎和术后感染，改善肠道菌群组成和局部免疫功能。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e143d0e94eb670b6a7e529de",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "接受放化疗的胃肠道肿瘤患者",
            "finding": "模型菌株LGG被证实能通过释放脂磷壁酸（LTA）激活隐窝周围巨噬细胞，从而选择性保护正常肠上皮干细胞免受辐射诱导的凋亡，而不影响肿瘤细胞，起到“时间释放胶囊”般的放射保护作用。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::589f7e8c39230005464d987f",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::be22e5b25492a3fed5d88a29",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "探究肠道微生物群如何影响癌症治疗的结局，特别是益生菌能否作为安全有效的辅助手段来减轻抗癌治疗（化疗、放疗、免疫治疗）的胃肠道副作用，并增强免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e8acf565078abc3a85bacad5",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "人类肠道微生物群（gut microbiota）与癌症及其治疗的关系，重点聚焦于益生菌作为抗癌治疗辅助手段的临床应用及机制。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b6c9e01d144ad53cb1611b26",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "这是一篇2019年发表的综述文章，旨在总结肠道微生物群在癌症发生发展中的作用，以及益生菌作为辅助疗法在减轻抗癌治疗副作用和改善免疫检查点抑制剂疗效方面的最新临床进展。文章首先阐述了肠道菌群失调与癌症风险及治疗毒性的关联，随后回顾了多项临床试验，证明特定益生菌（如乳酸杆菌和双歧杆菌）能有效缓解化疗、放疗引起的腹泻和黏膜炎。特别地，文章详细讨论了模型菌株鼠李糖乳杆菌GG（LGG）的保护机制，并列举了大量正在进行的临床试验以评估其安全性和有效性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b14e80f9a7f421e778a5ee90",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这些发现主要基于黑色素瘤患者的观察性研究和动物FMT实验，尚未在广泛的其他实体瘤中普遍验证；且未说明这些菌群是原因还是结果。",
            "contribution": "提供了肠道菌群组成与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效关联的临床证据。指出黑色素瘤ICI响应者肠道中富集Akkermansia, Alistipes, Clostridiales等菌属，而非响应者则不同。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::2d4cbfba6e3c600e35d0bafc",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "机制细节主要来自小鼠模型（FMT实验），人体内的确切分子通路尚不完全清楚；不同研究识别出的关键菌种存在差异（如有的强调Akkermansia，有的强调Bifidobacterium），提示情境依赖性。",
            "contribution": "揭示了特定细菌介导ICI疗效增强的潜在机制线索。例如，Akkermansia muciniphila可增加肿瘤内细胞毒性T细胞浸润；Bifidobacterium longum等也被认为能改善PD-L1疗效。同时提出了抗生素使用破坏菌群导致ICI疗效下降的反面证据。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b520a3be90c3e52e0e98c71a",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这是间接效应，不直接回答菌群如何生物化学地调节ICI靶点或免疫通路。",
            "contribution": "提供了益生菌（非特定共生菌，而是补充剂）可能间接影响治疗结局的背景。虽然主要关注副作用缓解，但指出维持健康的肠道平衡可能防止因严重副作用导致的停药，从而间接保证ICI疗程的完成。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::fee4e8bf5f4ec766e01a8391",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "将益生菌的作用分为两类：1) 缓解胃肠道毒性（腹泻、黏膜炎）以提高生活质量/依从性；2) 作为免疫调节剂增强ICI疗效。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::79cab45f7e4752c2bb82585a",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "LGG通过释放LTA激活巨噬细胞保护正常肠细胞的机制。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7e5917ce1d1f8f5876a84c76",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "癌症患者常处于免疫抑制状态，使用益生菌可能存在机会性感染和抗生素耐药基因转移的风险。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::db497ebde7996862e20e5599",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述主要基于2019年之前的文献，后续可能有更多更新的研究出现。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f5418f50017f7bc5c7b7ebf4",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "文中提到的ICI疗效增强证据多来自黑色素瘤，外推到其他实体瘤需谨慎。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::69c82aa40e101f1d3f0618ef",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "区分“特定肠道共生菌”（如Akkermansia，自然存在于体内）与“外源性益生菌补充剂”（如LGG，作为药物/补充剂给予）的不同作用模式和证据等级。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0040"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f6037a1d0608677fe5924a2f",
          "source_handle": "P0040",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "不要将动物模型（FMT）的结果直接等同于人体临床疗效，需注明这是机制探索阶段的证据。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::a9cc67de57f6216f432e18b5"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch6",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_006\\b56751a8f394813e6767aa8efd24825055cb0b332ed100bfcc9c8be800506c10\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
