        {
          "atom_id": "atom::320fb9443b29f631a256d1d4",
          "source_handle": "P0045",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b5ffa54698a5c4af1cec136e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0045"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::41aeb07965852bce86ea4e11",
          "source_handle": "P0045",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物组可能通过调节免疫通路影响宿主免疫及对免疫检查点抑制剂的反应，但关于GM多样性如何影响胃肠道和乳腺癌新辅助治疗后的病理完全缓解尚不清楚。本研究旨在解决这一知识空白。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b5ffa54698a5c4af1cec136e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0045"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ff38897831fd6a0ec9f1ff49",
          "source_handle": "P0045",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "爱尔兰多中心前瞻性转化研究，针对早期乳腺癌、直肠癌和食管癌患者，在开始新辅助治疗（化疗、免疫治疗或放化疗）前及治疗后不同时间点收集粪便样本。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b5ffa54698a5c4af1cec136e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0045"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f72f8d50d6728b9c9231a8ea",
          "source_handle": "P0045",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该论文介绍了一项正在进行的爱尔兰多中心转化研究，旨在探讨基线肠道微生物组（GM）多样性与新辅助治疗后病理完全缓解（pCR）之间的关联。研究假设基线GM多样性更高将导致更好的病理反应。目前招募仍在进行中，已纳入14名患者，预计2025年初得出结果。摘要主要描述了研究设计、可行性验证及初步招募情况，未提供最终的统计分析结果或发现。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b5ffa54698a5c4af1cec136e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0045"
        },
