            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该论文仅为研究方案/进展报告，无最终结果。切勿将其假设或计划当作已证实的发现。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::b5ffa54698a5c4af1cec136e"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0045"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::28f4868d4c01ef55c8555742",
          "source_handle": "P0045",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "研究人群限定为爱尔兰早期乳腺癌、直肠癌和食管癌患者，结果外推需谨慎。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
