        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3b21322b3c2a9132505b4be2",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "采用系统综述和荟萃分析方法。文献检索来源为PubMed和主要肿瘤学会议论文集。纳入标准包括报告基于抗生素暴露的HR或Kaplan-Meier曲线（用于OS和PFS），以及ORR和PD数据的研究。统计分析计算合并的HR（OS, PFS）和OR（ORR, PD），并按抗生素暴露的时间窗口进行亚组分析以评估时序效应。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::da109f1ebbcdc5d6f2ef54f8",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提供了截至2021年中期的最新大规模荟萃分析证据，量化了抗生素对NSCLC患者ICI治疗OS、PFS、ORR和PD的综合影响，并细化了时间窗口的效应差异。",
            "limits": "所给材料未交代具体的异质性检验结果、发表偏倚评估细节、抗生素种类/疗程的细分分析、以及纳入研究的基线特征平衡情况。机制部分仅引用文献讨论，未在本研究中提供新的实验验证。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6aa00d38dd2f8ad3784ffcaa",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "纳入35个独立队列，共12,235名NSCLC患者；比较抗生素暴露组与非暴露组。",
            "finding": "合并HR显示OS为1.63 [95% CI 1.37-1.94]，PFS为1.49 [95% CI 1.26-1.76]，表明抗生素暴露显著降低生存率。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b9a8a0e465e1a8a6737b9e5c",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "针对ORR和PD的分析，分别纳入1,992名和1,272名患者。",
            "finding": "合并OR显示ORR为0.66 [95% CI 0.44-0.99]，PD为1.98 [95% CI 1.39-2.8]，表明抗生素使用者治疗反应几率降低，疾病进展几率几乎翻倍。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::65429ad017216a89c4e2c9b4",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "基于抗生素暴露时间窗口的亚组分析。",
            "finding": "在ICI启动前后使用抗生素显示出更明显的有害效应。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c67b9bc8809e26e302b6087d",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::37377881090db7101f49c1ca",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管已有研究表明肠道微生物群失调可能影响ICI疗效，且既往研究提示抗生素有害，但需要更新最新证据并更全面地评估抗生素对NSCLC患者ICI治疗的多项临床结局（包括生存、缓解和进展）的具体影响程度及时间依赖性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::53cbcfda31c1102c91f23106",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗，暴露于抗生素（ABX）与未暴露的对比。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c34c387964e101ba04f34906",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "该研究是一项系统综述和荟萃分析，旨在更新并扩展作者此前在2020年发表的相关工作。通过检索PubMed及主要肿瘤学会议论文集，纳入截至2021年7月发表的评估抗生素使用对NSCLC患者ICI治疗临床结局影响的研究。研究综合了35个独立队列的数据，分析了总生存期（OS）、无进展生存期（PFS）、总体缓解率（ORR）和疾病进展率（PD），并根据抗生素暴露的时间窗口进行了亚组分析。结果显示，抗生素暴露显著降低患者的生存率和治疗反应率，增加疾病进展风险，特别是在ICI启动前后使用的危害更为明显。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::728295ab171faf132c05750e",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅限于NSCLC人群，不能直接外推至所有实体瘤或其他癌症类型，除非有证据表明效应一致。未区分不同类别抗生素的影响。",
            "contribution": "提供了抗生素暴露作为负面调节因子影响ICI疗效的大样本荟萃分析数据（HR/OR值）。具体显示了OS HR=1.63, PFS HR=1.49, ORR OR=0.66, PD OR=1.98。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::d0eb337a3b37ac077ee731ab",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "本综述本身未提供新的机制实验数据，仅汇总临床结局证据并引用其他研究的机制假说。不能据此推断具体的分子通路。",
            "contribution": "虽然不直接揭示分子机制，但通过确认抗生素（导致菌群失调）与疗效降低的强关联，间接支持了“微生物群完整性对ICI疗效至关重要”的假设。文中提及的两种潜在机制（细菌分子的免疫调节作用、共生菌与肿瘤抗原的抗原模拟）为机制探讨提供了文献背景。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::54a63f2cdf8c20368f50fc59",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "发现ICI启动前后使用抗生素危害最大。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::da977602f0fcc6aa67dbfa36",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "35个队列，12,235名患者的汇总分析。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::43162a461155225b85089ba5",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该研究仅针对非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC），在将其结论应用于其他实体瘤（如黑色素瘤、肾癌等，这些也是ICI研究热点）时需格外谨慎，尽管机制可能相似，但效应大小可能不同。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::06b11c6b33c0657f52d70e12",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "抗生素是一个异质性群体，本研究未区分抗生素的种类、谱系或疗程，因此“抗生素”作为一个整体类别的效应掩盖了潜在的差异性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::46c7117af78a699a33d170c9",
          "source_handle": "P0052",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "观察性研究的汇总存在固有的混杂偏倚风险（如抗生素使用可能与感染严重程度、一般健康状况相关），尽管荟萃分析试图控制，但不能完全确立因果关系。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch4",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_004\\b995d57956e84cb840b6d426921fbc748165b7d5bcb76b80cd617161c4b4a22f\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0052"
        },
        {
