        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0a525502ff5e378e81a97a66",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "旨在回答：肠道微生物群在癌症免疫治疗中扮演什么角色？其影响疗效的具体机制是什么？目前有哪些方法可以利用这一知识优化治疗效果？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::48b76de668c575df11e5da7e",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "肠道微生物群（gut microbiome）与癌症免疫治疗（特别是免疫检查点抑制剂 ICB，如抗PD-1/PD-L1和抗CTLA-4）疗效之间的关联。涵盖从基础微生物学、无菌小鼠模型机制研究到临床相关性证据的综合回顾。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b01bc4859983a1d7d81ea157",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇综述，系统梳理了肠道微生物群如何影响癌症免疫治疗的疗效。文章首先介绍了宿主-微生物相互作用的基础研究方法（如16S rRNA测序、宏基因组测序及无菌/悉生小鼠模型的使用及其局限性），随后总结了证明肠道菌群组成与免疫治疗疗效存在因果联系的关键实验证据（包括动物模型中的定植实验和人类队列的相关性研究）。接着，文章详细探讨了可能的生物学机制，包括活细菌或微生物相关分子模式（MAMPs/PAMPs）作为信使通过增强抗原性、佐剂效应或旁观者激活来调节抗肿瘤免疫，以及微生物代谢物（如短链脂肪酸）和宿主细胞因子作为信使的作用。最后，文章讨论了将微生物组作为预后生物标志物、谨慎使用抗生素以及开发基于微生物组的干预策略（如FMT、益生菌、噬菌体疗法）的临床前景，并指出了当前研究的局限性和未来方向。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b0c5a8d7c38eaaab6e57cf00",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅展示相关性或初步因果推断，未确立通用的‘最佳菌群’配方；不同研究间的具体菌种列表不完全重合，需谨慎引用具体物种。",
            "contribution": "列举了与ICBs疗效正负相关的特定细菌类群（如双歧杆菌、阿克曼氏菌与响应正相关；某些拟杆菌与耐药或结肠炎相关），并指出这种关联在不同研究中存在不一致性，提示情境依赖性。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cfb9703de7d635e116138ace",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这是理论假设和早期证据的汇总，许多机制（如具体的交叉反应肽段、特定的代谢物浓度阈值）尚未在人体中得到完全验证或量化。",
            "contribution": "提出了一个系统的机制分类框架，区分了四种主要信使类型（活细菌/MAMPs、代谢物、细胞因子、免疫细胞）及其对应的免疫效应（增强抗原性、佐剂效应、旁观者激活、抑制性调节）。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::5066353359ccce6eaf061846",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "文中详细对比了16S rRNA测序与宏基因组测序的优缺点，以及无菌小鼠模型的生理缺陷和微生物残留干扰问题。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f9f44dd21b9842e42af4e79a",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "概述了FMT、益生元/饮食调整、益生菌、噬菌体和代谢物补充等多种干预手段的原理及当前进展。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e48120ecf4cebc5e1bafcaa0",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "指出当前研究多聚焦于细菌，而真菌（mycobiome）和病毒（virome）也可能调节免疫，但目前证据较少。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::01c5d880718ea85b7b6946a3",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述涵盖多种癌症类型（黑色素瘤、肺癌、肾癌、胰腺癌等）和多种ICI药物，但在具体机制上多为小鼠模型推导，需区分动物实验结论与人类临床证据的强度差异。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::19a3a17ed39f9ff6414416d1",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "文中提到的‘共识’是基于多篇独立研究的汇总，而非单一大型随机对照试验的结果，因此具体菌种的预测价值仍存在争议和不一致性。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::05c51b859eba2ea39414cad8",
          "source_handle": "P0055",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "机制部分包含大量‘假说’和‘潜在’通路，并非所有提及的机制都在人类实体瘤中得到了直接证实，引用时需保持谨慎，避免过度解读因果关系。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::be68bb0094ea724179acc240"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch7",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_007\\64c910a3a897b68c48b39fd88d4fd623cb88438f2742fba7317c27a24293bba7\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0055"
