            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "采用系统性文献综述方法。作者检索并综合了多项临床研究（涉及16S rRNA测序和宏基因组测序）的结果，对比分析响应者与无响应者的微生物组成差异。同时，整合了基础研究的机制发现，重点分析微生物代谢物（SCFAs、胆汁酸等）与宿主免疫系统（TLR信号、cGAS/STING通路等）的交互作用。此外，还结合了肿瘤异质性（病因、基因、代谢）背景，讨论微生物组在不同亚型HCC中的特异性表现。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::0cb4e4ad111e1b49747ed92f",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "系统总结了HCC患者中区分ICI响应者与无响应者的具体微生物分类学特征和功能通路，提供了潜在的预测生物标志物列表。",
            "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索数据库、时间范围及纳入排除标准，无法评估综述的全面性和偏倚风险。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b00dcdd9eb00a66a74612344",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "构建了“微生物-代谢物-免疫”在HCC免疫治疗中的机制框架，特别是强调了胆汁酸和SCFAs的作用。",
            "limits": "机制部分主要基于转述的基础研究和少量临床关联数据，许多因果链条（如特定菌株直接导致特定代谢物变化进而改善预后）在人类HCC中尚未完全确证，存在动物模型外推的不确定性。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::5c3f99e6a4485b196a616344",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "识别了肿瘤异质性（病因、基因、代谢）对微生物组-免疫互作的影响，提示个性化微生物干预的必要性。",
            "limits": "对于不同异质性亚型的具体干预策略缺乏直接的临床证据支持，多为理论推导或基于其他癌症类型的类比。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cfea509b7c87fc208f5c569c",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "指出了当前研究的方法学局限（如测序方法、分析流程不一致）和未来方向（多组学、标准化）。",
            "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于已发表研究的质量，未能提供新的原始数据或独立验证队列。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::851db4dec05ec03b53c55a5d",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "ICI单药治疗（如Nivolumab, Camrelizumab）",
            "finding": "响应者通常表现出更高的微生物多样性（Shannon指数）和特定菌属富集，如Akkermansia muciniphila、Ruminococcaceae、Citrobacter freundii；无响应者则富集Proteobacteria、Escherichia coli、Dialister pneumosintes及Prevotella。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::3928c283a8e4280e54c54f41",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "ICI联合TKI治疗",
            "finding": "组合疗法显示出优于单药的临床结果，微生物特征显示Lachnospiraceae、Ruminococcus、Faecalibacterium等有益菌在响应者中富集，而Bacteroides、Veillonella等在部分研究中与无响应相关。不同研究间存在显著的菌群标识差异，可能与方法学变异有关。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e041d2a6f54b96184e595f54",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "微生物干预措施",
            "finding": "抗生素暴露通常与ICIs疗效降低和不良事件增加相关，但个别研究显示短期窗口期内的特定抗生素可能增强疗效。益生菌（如Probio-M9/Lactobacillus rhamnosus）在临床试验中提高了ORR。FMT在早期试验中显示出激活CD4+/CD8+ T细胞和抑制肿瘤生长的潜力，但安全性和标准化仍是主要障碍。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::277be6ab0272039613e4b0f7",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "机制层面：代谢物与免疫调节",
            "finding": "微生物代谢物如SCFAs维持肠道屏障并抑制肿瘤增殖；次级胆汁酸（UDCA, TUDCA）通过激活NKT细胞分泌IFN-γ/TNF增强抗肿瘤免疫；MAMPs通过TLR通路招募免疫细胞但也可能导致炎症和致癌。特定菌株（如A. muciniphila）可通过STING通路激活DC细胞和NK细胞。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::df76f3e6937337b3b73537db",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "肿瘤异质性背景",
            "finding": "HBV/HCV相关HCC与Enterobacteriaceae升高及炎症反应增强相关；NASH相关HCC与Bacteroides/Ruminococcus富集及免疫抑制性胆汁酸代谢相关。CTNNB1突变导致免疫排斥表型，可能富集Fusobacterium nucleatum；TP53缺失导致屏障功能障碍和LPS易位。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::083cc10c162534396b0dcf19",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "review",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::339bb9290d98f30377030301",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "尽管ICIs在晚期HCC中显示出一定疗效，但总体响应率有限且存在原发性耐药。目前缺乏可靠的预测生物标志物，且需要阐明肠道微生物组作为预测因子和治疗调节剂的具体作用机制，以优化患者分层和治疗方案。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::7b089703cb17dc3c4ee5b187",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "肝细胞癌（HCC）患者；免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂及与靶向药物TKI的联合治疗）；肠道微生物组及其代谢产物。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c0cd375f708cdac5da432b15",
          "source_handle": "P0113",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本文是一篇关于肠道微生物组如何影响肝细胞癌（HCC）对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效的系统综述。文章首先梳理了不同治疗方案（单药、TKI单药、ICI联合TKI）下，响应者与无响应者之间特定的肠道微生物特征差异，指出如Akkermansia muciniphila、Ruminococcaceae等菌属与良好预后相关，而Bacteroides等则常与耐药相关。其次，文章评估了基于微生物组的干预策略，包括抗生素使用、益生菌补充、益生元摄入和粪便微生物群移植（FMT），并讨论了其临床潜力与挑战。机制部分详细阐述了微生物通过调节肿瘤微环境（TME）中的免疫细胞（如CD8+ T细胞、NK细胞、Tregs）以及产生关键代谢物（如短链脂肪酸SCFAs、次级胆汁酸、MAMPs）来增强抗肿瘤免疫反应的路径。最后，文章探讨了HCC病因异质性（病毒性 vs. 代谢性/NASH）、肿瘤遗传及代谢异质性与微生物组的相互作用，并指出了多组学整合、标准化临床试验及伦理物流挑战等未来方向。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch2",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_002\\2af2f48e7a68a8b8fa9ae892ee0e5e2536f3aee44be4bd76f4e9431182e6f9b9\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0113"
        },
