        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::88f3e55bf1ae1ac6c273ebb9",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "material_status"
          ],
          "value": "resolved",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ebed2f5ac387e83ad87e7140",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ],
          "value": "1. 队列设计：纳入62名接受抗PD-1治疗的晚期NSCLC患者作为发现队列，另设60名患者作为验证队列。记录临床参数（PFS、PD-L1状态、化疗史、合并用药）。 2. 样本处理与测序：收集粪便样本，提取DNA，进行鸟枪法宏基因组测序。 3. 数据分析： - 多样性分析：计算Alpha多样性（Shannon指数）和Beta多样性（UMAP/Permanova）。 - 差异丰度分析：使用Wilcoxon秩和检验比较不同临床分组间的门、属、种水平细菌丰度。 - 网络分析：构建细菌相互作用网络，比较长/短PFS患者的网络拓扑结构差异。 - 多变量建模：使用Lasso回归和Cox比例风险回归建立预测模型，识别独立预测因子。 - 机器学习：使用随机森林（Random Forest）算法评估分类学和代谢通路数据对PFS、PD-L1状态和化疗史的预测性能（AUC）。 - 验证：在独立队列中验证关键物种的预测价值。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::f1d1143f97e2b70b55b65ecb",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits"
          ],
          "value": {
            "contribution": "提供了针对高加索人种NSCLC患者的详细肠道宏基因组图谱，区分了分类学（预测PFS）和代谢通路（预测PD-L1）的不同预测价值。确认了Alistipes和Barnesiella为正预测因子，Streptococcus和Bifidobacterium为负预测因子，并建立了分层预测模型。",
            "limits": "横断面研究设计，无法确定因果关系（是微生物导致疗效差异，还是疾病状态改变了微生物）。样本量相对较小（发现队列n=62），且仅包含高加索人种，外推至其他种族需谨慎。未检测肿瘤组织突变负荷（TMB）。部分结果（如B. adolescentis）在验证队列中未达显著性。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::daa4adaeb566ae2e4e93d726",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "长PFS (>6个月) vs 短PFS (≤6个月)",
            "finding": "Alpha多样性无显著差异；Beta多样性有显著差异。短PFS患者中厚壁菌门（Firmicutes）和放线菌门（Actinobacteria）丰度增加，F/B比率升高。长PFS与Alistipes shahii, A. finegoldii, Barnesiella visceriola正相关；短PFS与Streptococcus salivarius, S. vestibularis, Bifidobacterium breve正相关。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1b02db1847acf319c9a23061",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "PD-L1高表达 vs 低表达",
            "finding": "Beta多样性无显著差异。PD-L1低表达患者中Euryarcheota丰度较高。代谢通路方面，核苷酸降解、氨基酸合成和发酵通路在PD-L1低表达患者中更丰富。代谢通路比分类学更能预测PD-L1状态（AUC=0.87）。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::23e65bda95e038e310d76c62",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "化疗预处理（CHT-treated）vs 未预处理（CHT-naïve）",
            "finding": "两组间Beta多样性有显著差异。CHT处理后患者中氨基酸降解和碳水化合物合成通路增加。CHT预处理本身并未将微生物组推向“短PFS”表型，但CHT-treated患者整体预后略差。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::1282b78e315c719d1bfc2099",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "合并用药影响",
            "finding": "抗生素使用导致Anaerostipes等减少，Eggerthella增加。抗酸药使用导致链球菌属（如S. salivarius）增加，这与短PFS相关。类固醇使用与变形菌门（Proteobacteria）增加相关。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::30a849bac9eec2a626e799b8",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9b8a520e6bc1a694a78a82ef",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "在晚期NSCLC患者中，肠道微生物组的组成（分类学）和功能（代谢通路）是否与抗PD-1免疫治疗的临床疗效（以PFS衡量）及肿瘤PD-L1表达水平存在显著关联？这些微生物特征能否作为预测治疗反应的生物标志物？",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::b86a953cd31325f3a920fcc5",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "62名接受抗PD-1免疫治疗（ICI）的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者（发现队列），以及60名独立验证队列患者。研究对象为高加索人种，样本来源为粪便微生物组。研究情境包括一线化疗前（CHT-naïve）与后续线化疗后（CHT-treated）的治疗背景，以及伴随使用的抗生素、抗酸药和类固醇药物。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::69562d75bc6fc432187b293b",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在探究肠道微生物组特征与非小细胞肺癌患者抗PD-1免疫治疗疗效及PD-L1表达之间的关联。研究团队对62名患者进行了宏基因组测序，分析细菌多样性、分类学组成及代谢通路，并将其与无进展生存期（PFS）、PD-L1免疫组化表达及其他临床参数进行相关性分析。通过多变量统计模型筛选关键预测菌种，并在60人的独立队列中进行验证。同时，利用随机森林机器学习算法评估分类学和代谢通路特征对临床结局的预测能力。研究发现特定细菌物种及其代谢功能可作为ICI疗效和PD-L1状态的生物标志物。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::fe2e2c8cd6b7b9cbfa3d0132",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅限NSCLC患者；观察性关联，非因果证明；基于宏基因组测序，非16S rRNA；主要适用于高加索人群。",
            "contribution": "提供了具体的细菌分类学特征与ICI疗效（PFS）的关联证据。具体包括：长PFS相关的有益菌（Alistipes shahii, A. finegoldii, Barnesiella visceriola）和短PFS相关的有害菌（Streptococcus salivarius, S. vestibularis, Bifidobacterium breve）。证实了Taxonomic profiles在预测PFS方面的有效性（AUC=0.74）。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::22a0fe6aa2f35eab3a16f5df",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅在37名患者的子集中分析了代谢通路；预测的是PD-L1表达而非直接的治疗响应；需结合其他研究验证代谢通路的普遍性。",
            "contribution": "提供了代谢通路特征与PD-L1表达状态的关联。发现PD-L1低表达患者中核苷酸降解、氨基酸合成和发酵通路更活跃。指出Metabolic pathways在预测PD-L1状态上优于分类学（AUC=0.87）。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::165aa3a3f5f4973cd5c20cec",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "机制主要为推测性讨论，缺乏直接的实验验证（如动物模型或体外实验）；网络分析仅为相关性。",
            "contribution": "提出了微生物组可能通过分子模拟（molecular mimicry）或肠-肺轴影响免疫微环境的背景机制讨论，并观察到长PFS患者中细菌网络更具连通性（hub species如S. vestibularis, B. uniformis等）。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::79d62bbddd89e6d8142e93d0",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "观察性数据，无法排除适应症偏倚（例如，使用抗酸药的患者可能有不同的基础疾病严重程度）。",
            "contribution": "评估了辅助治疗（抗生素、抗酸药、类固醇）对微生物组组成的干扰。发现抗酸药（PPI/H-blocker）使用与短PFS相关菌种（链球菌）的增加有关，提示药物可能间接影响疗效。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0123"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::cd15e9e909619ce769f313c3",
          "source_handle": "P0123",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "作者指出其与东亚NSCLC研究（Jin et al., Zhang et al.）结果的差异，归因于种族基线菌群差异、测序方法（宏基因组vs 16S）和参考数据库的不同。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::76339214318d6dae2602ad36"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
