        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::a9b21bb5521d854910bc6f15",
          "source_handle": "P0124",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "该综述为叙述性综述，非系统评价或荟萃分析，因此其结论代表了作者的综合性观点而非严格的统计汇总。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::880a4cdb0c38e0b0bd47c6f0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0124"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::47ad2c025201af5d593c97c1",
          "source_handle": "P0124",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "所引用的机制研究多来自小鼠模型或体外实验，其在人体内的直接适用性和效力可能存在差异，需谨慎外推。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::880a4cdb0c38e0b0bd47c6f0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0124"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::c02b5d6501d4c29b43a5f340",
          "source_handle": "P0124",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "不同地理区域和饮食习惯导致的微生物基线差异可能影响某些菌群标志物的普适性，特别是在跨种族比较时。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::880a4cdb0c38e0b0bd47c6f0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_003\\91eee61491f488e16f81be04d8f112d83ba92e728c1e4bb2c3b0864271a87189\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0124"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::9162fac3f0939bac1f86cf0b",
          "source_handle": "P0124",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions"
          ],
          "value": "关于“微生物性别组”的内容较为新兴，具体机制和临床意义仍需更多研究证实，目前主要作为假设提出。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::880a4cdb0c38e0b0bd47c6f0"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch3",
