        {
          "atom_id": "atom::6419dd7088c2e53b13242b6f",
          "source_handle": "P0134",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings"
          ],
          "value": {
            "conditions": "无响应者（Non-responders）治疗后的特定菌属变化",
            "finding": "Prevotella, Porphyromonas, Streptococcus, 和 Escheria-Shigella 的丰度显著增加；Akkermansia 的丰度显著下降。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c668512a6c9823161aab5aff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0134"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::ea9986a3cf5236e55a897e3f",
          "source_handle": "P0134",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ],
          "value": "empirical",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c668512a6c9823161aab5aff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0134"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::abc522398739e5d4c58fea4c",
          "source_handle": "P0134",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ],
          "value": "主要问题：目前缺乏有效的非侵入性生物标志物来早期识别对PD-1/PD-L1阻断疗法有反应的NSCLC患者，且基线微生物组与疗效的关系尚不明确。具体动机：尽管已知抗生素使用影响ICI疗效，但治疗过程中肠道微生物组的组成变化及其与疗效的具体关系仍不清楚。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c668512a6c9823161aab5aff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0134"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e2d15979eaa156c5f0e78cb3",
          "source_handle": "P0134",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ],
          "value": "研究对象为接受抗PD-1免疫治疗（单药或联合化疗）的III期至IV期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者。研究情境为Roswell Park Comprehensive Cancer Center的前瞻性队列，样本量为5名患者（3名响应者，2名无响应者）。范围聚焦于治疗前及早期治疗期间粪便样本中肠道微生物组的动态变化及其与临床疗效的关系。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c668512a6c9823161aab5aff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0134"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::38d2935668ccaa759a6b6432",
          "source_handle": "P0134",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ],
          "value": "本研究旨在探索肠道微生物组在治疗过程中的动态变化是否能作为预测非小细胞肺癌患者对PD-1抑制剂反应的非侵入性生物标志物。鉴于基线微生物组特征和肿瘤组织PD-L1表达的预测价值有限，作者分析了5名患者的配对粪便样本，通过16S rRNA测序比较响应者与无响应者在治疗前后的微生物多样性及组成差异。研究发现，虽然基线α多样性在两组间无显著差异，但响应者在治疗期间的微生物多样性发生了显著改变，而无响应者则相对稳定或呈现不同的菌群演变模式。这表明治疗期间的微生物组波动可能与免疫治疗的疗效相关。",
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c668512a6c9823161aab5aff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0134"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::60bb2b4a9aa9df9db01788b3",
          "source_handle": "P0134",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "仅限NSCLC人群，样本量小（N=5），且混合了单药与联合化疗方案，结果的外推需谨慎。不能证明因果关系，仅为关联观察。",
            "contribution": "提供了具体的临床观察证据：在NSCLC患者中，治疗期间肠道微生物组的显著变化（波动）与抗PD-1治疗的响应正相关，而稳定的或特定菌属（如Akkermansia减少）的变化与无响应相关。",
            "facet_id": "F1"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c668512a6c9823161aab5aff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0134"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::e83c2e1bd28e65ccf7087396",
          "source_handle": "P0134",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions"
          ],
          "value": {
            "boundaries": "这是相关性发现，未提供直接的机制验证（如代谢产物分析或动物模型验证）。所给材料未交代这些菌属变化的具体分子机制。",
            "contribution": "提示了潜在的机制线索：响应者中Clostridium sensu stricto 1的增加和无响应者中Akkermansia的减少可能与免疫激活或抑制有关。同时指出Escheria-Shigella在无响应者中的增加与既往文献一致。",
            "facet_id": "F2"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c668512a6c9823161aab5aff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
          "raw_source_handle": "P0134"
        },
        {
          "atom_id": "atom::eab5db6ff6e6bd9baf462ffc",
          "source_handle": "P0134",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses"
          ],
          "value": {
            "material": "论文引言讨论了基线微生物组、抗生素使用、粪菌移植（FMT）与ICI疗效的关系，以及当前基线生物标志物（如PD-L1）的局限性。"
          },
          "role": "evidence",
          "snapshot_ids": [
            "snapshot::c668512a6c9823161aab5aff"
          ],
          "author_chapter_id": "Ch1",
          "author_messages_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\guided_body_compact_auto_metadata_20261009_12cny\\LIVE\\stages\\author_001\\47be7e22b5ff720e1d0f995795f678f363ed33890ab836f8c1baae006ee530dc\\attempt_001\\MESSAGES.json",
